P actions make_etude
P memjob 3072000
P memory_limit 3000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterHarmonic
P version stable
A memjeveux 512.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 20000.0
F mmed AsterHarmonicinput.med D  20
F comm AsterHarmonicparam.in D  1
F comm AsterHarmonicDirect.comm D  1
F comm AsterHarmonicPostPro.comm D 1
F comm AsterHarmonicAdjoint.comm D  1
F comm AsterHarmonicShapeDerivative.comm D  1
F rmed direct.rmed R  81
F mess AsterHarmonic.log R  6
F rmed adjoint.rmed R  82
F tab AsterHarmonic_objective.csv R  27
F rmed AsterHarmonicoutput.rmed R  83
